  3.986620273725891*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"44ff0393-45da-9c47-a960-\
706bcd34b1a4"],

Cell["\<\
In this case let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s use the arrangement of trajectories found \
on Pere\[CloseCurlyQuote]s paper. Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s first define the \
parameters.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9866201036919556`*^9, 3.9866201080202427`*^9}, {
