Cell["\<\
Now let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s do the fits, and just get the arrangements that \
give us reasonable results.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9873265061806393`*^9, 3.9873265184327297`*^9}, {
  3.987933440535879*^9, 
  3.9879334706062183`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ba610d97-e255-0940-a089-\
