Cell["\<\
Those are too many trajectories to analyze. So let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s keep \
just the ones that make sense. Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s see first if a \
reparametrization on the angles is possible in case we get both initial mass \
and slope negative.\
\>", "Text",
