Cell["\<\
The reparametrization is not trivial but seems possible. \
Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s keep then the solutions where all parameters are \
positive (but the angles) and the solutions that give the both correspondent \
initial masses and slopes positive. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9879175572424965`*^9, 3.9879175795307255`*^9}, {
