Cell["Now let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s assure that all mathematical masses are \
positive.", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.988388834844101*^9, 3.98838885173365*^9}, {
  3.9883888922280617`*^9, 
  3.988388907860441*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"cb05f148-6c37-984b-b0ea-\
