Cell["\<\
Issue: The third trajectory that is supposed to be the most massive is the \
one with lowest widths, and they are proportional to the mass, so they should \
be the largest.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.988635316033846*^9, 3.9886353689178047`*^9}, {
  3.9886354400944023`*^9, 
